      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Countryside%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city was officially incorporated in 1960 after decades of farmland and post‑war suburban growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Countryside%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first residential subdivision, LaGrange Terrace, appeared in 1947, marking the start of Countryside’s transition from rural farmland.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Countryside%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Stevenson Expressway’s construction in the mid‑1960s spurred retail and industrial development around Countryside, including a landmark 548,000‑sq‑foot complex.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.countryside-il.org/general/history.php"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Countryside is home to the International Union of Operating Engineers Local 150, headquartered at 6200 Joliet Road.",
